{
    "title": "Scentbird Monthly Perfume Box",
    "description": "A single tap on the Scentbird app unlocks a world of fragrance at your fingertips. Indulge in a monthly perfume subscription plan, offering over 600 fragrances to choose from. Take 50% off your first month and receive a 30-day supply of fragrance for only $8.47.  Indulge in a new designer scent every 30 days and continually explore a wide library of scents suitable for every mood, occasion, and season. Discover various scented luxuries, including full-size bottles, discovery sets, luxe car fresheners, candles, and more \u2013 ideal for gifting or treating yourself.\r\n\r\nUnlock the full potential of the Scentbird app and experience a range of exciting features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Browse through our vast collection of artisan and designer scents, easily filtering by brand, category, scent profile, rating, or individual notes.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Be the first in line to access exclusive sales. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Seamlessly manage your queue by adding, removing, or rearranging products.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Stay updated with new arrivals, best-sellers, and featured fragrances of the month.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Track your orders and receive shipping updates.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Share your valuable feedback by rating and reviewing your past purchases.",
    "descriptionHTML": "A single tap on the Scentbird app unlocks a world of fragrance at your fingertips. Indulge in a monthly perfume subscription plan, offering over 600 fragrances to choose from. Take 50% off your first month and receive a 30-day supply of fragrance for only $8.47.  Indulge in a new designer scent every 30 days and continually explore a wide library of scents suitable for every mood, occasion, and season. Discover various scented luxuries, including full-size bottles, discovery sets, luxe car fresheners, candles, and more \u2013 ideal for gifting or treating yourself.<br><br>Unlock the full potential of the Scentbird app and experience a range of exciting features:<br><br>\u2022 Browse through our vast collection of artisan and designer scents, easily filtering by brand, category, scent profile, rating, or individual notes.<br><br>\u2022 Be the first in line to access exclusive sales. <br><br>\u2022 Seamlessly manage your queue by adding, removing, or rearranging products.<br><br>\u2022 Stay updated with new arrivals, best-sellers, and featured fragrances of the month.<br><br>\u2022 Track your orders and receive shipping updates.<br><br>\u2022 Share your valuable feedback by rating and reviewing your past purchases.",
